<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TEJ details 6.2 mln rand rights offer terms.</title>
<headline>TEJ details 6.2 mln rand rights offer terms.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African clothing company Towles, Edgar Jacobs Ltd (TEJ) on Monday detailed the terms of its planned rights offer and said it aimed to raise 6.2 million rand.</p>
<p>The firm said it would issue 2.072 milion shares at a price of 300 cents each. The offer is in the ratio of 40 shares for every 100 shares held.</p>
<p>The offer is being underwritten by Fedsure Asset Management Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
